Residents have been requesting removal of the garbage dump, yet instead of removing it, the dump is now being expanded and taking up additional road space.

The road, once ~25 ft wide, is already severely constricted, creating traffic, hygiene and safety concerns. Now we are told a garbage-crushing machine may also be installed at the site.

Why expand an existing nuisance instead of resolving it?

Please stop further expansion, do not encroach on the road, and halt installation of the machine until residents' concerns are properly addressed.

We request an urgent site inspection and a permanent solution, not further expansion of the problem.

#Delhi #SafdarjungEnclave #Humayunpur #MCD #WasteManagement #RoadSafety

